NOTE: This project is an independent, clean-room SwiftUI reimplementation
inspired by the web tool "BBox 位置设计器 · ideogram 4 元素定位"
(https://bbox.toolbuddy.art/). No source code from the original project was
copied — the original site is closed-source and, as of this writing, no
public source repository for it could be found on GitHub. This license
applies only to the code in this repository.
